{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49074","headline":"菩萨蛮 一 · 昭宗皇帝","name":"菩萨蛮 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登楼遥望秦宫殿，茫茫只见双飞燕。\n渭水一条流，千山与万丘。\n远烟笼碧树，陌上行人去。\n安得有英雄，迎归大内中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"昭宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}